Package: termstructuremodeling
Title: One-Factor Short Rate Models and Nelson-Siegel Curve Fitting
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Vectorised simulation of Vasicek, CIR, Hull-White and
    Black-Karasinski short rate models, closed-form zero-coupon bond prices
    where available, and Nelson-Siegel curve fitting against FRED Treasury
    yields. Not a published package; the DESCRIPTION file exists only so
    r-lib/actions/setup-r-dependencies can install the dependencies below.
    Scripts are run directly with Rscript, not via library(termstructuremodeling).
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    minpack.lm,
    quantmod,
    xts,
    zoo,
    ggplot2
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    kableExtra,
    rmarkdown
